  "description": "<p><b>Premier Wholesale Supplier of Natural Bamboo Woven Lampshades</b></p>\n<p>Partner with Vietnam Handicraft to enrich your inventory with our authentic, sustainably crafted lighting solutions. Our Bamboo Lampshade is meticulously hand-woven from fine, natural bamboo slats, offering retailers an exclusive product that captures the high-demand aesthetic of Coastal, Bohemian, and Modern Farmhouse interior design.</p>\n<p>As a wholesale manufacturer, we guarantee a consistent supply of high-quality fixtures that appeal to environmentally conscious consumers and interior designers globally.</p>\n<p><b>Product Excellence &amp; Design Specifications</b></p>\n<p>The unique selling points of our bamboo lampshade are rooted in its craftsmanship and material integrity:</p>\n<p><b>100% Natural Bamboo Slats:</b> Woven from carefully selected, treated bamboo strips (nan tre) for a smooth finish and excellent durability. The natural finish may be customized upon request (e.g., stained or lacquered). <b>Hand-Woven Precision:</b> Each shade is crafted by Vietnamese artisans, ensuring unique detail and structural integrity, differentiating it from mass-produced items.</p>\n<p><b>Ambient &amp; Textural Lighting:</b> The open-weave structure creates a warm, diffused light pattern, highly sought after for creating inviting atmospheres in living rooms, dining areas, hotels, and cafes. The shadow play is a key retail marketing feature.</p>\n<p><b>Ready for Installation:</b> Designed to fit standard lamp cord kits (hardware not included, unless specified for OEM). The structure is lightweight, yet resilient, minimizing freight costs while maximizing appeal.</p>\n<p>We offer <b>OEM/Private Label</b> services, including variations in weaving density, size customization (diameter/height), and custom packaging designed to your brand&#8217;s specifications.</p>\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 14.4px\">Supply Chain &amp; Wholesale Inquiries</b></p>\n<p>VIETCRAFT is committed to being your reliable long-term partner:</p>\n<p><b>Certification &amp; Compliance:</b> Our production processes adhere to international standards, with a focus on ethical sourcing and responsible manufacturing.</p>\n<p><b>Logistics:</b> We have optimized packaging for secure global shipping, providing competitive freight solutions.</p>\n<p><b>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ):</b> Please contact our B2B team to receive our current wholesale price list and MOQ requirements. We offer tiered pricing for volume purchases.</p>\n<p><b>Contact Us Today:</b> To request a full catalog of our lighting collection or discuss your specific OEM project, please reach out to our dedicated B2B sales desk.</p>\n<p>Email: vietcraft2006@gmail.com –  or call us at +84 975810168<br />\n</p>",
